Package: hostsfile-dyndns-updater
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), nginx | nginx-light | nginx-full, ssl-cert, adduser
Recommends: logrotate
Suggests: fail2ban
Maintainer: hostsfile-dyndns-updater maintainers <root@localhost>
Homepage: https://github.com/clu-pei-dae/hostsfile-dyndns-updater
Description: FritzBox DynDNS endpoint that maintains /etc/hosts
 Receives DynDNS updates from a FritzBox through nginx (TLS, rate limiting,
 authentication) and maps the announced address to a configured hostname in
 /etc/hosts.
